  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"Please, do not leave me.\" \n\n\"We should get a divorce. You don't love me, do you? We... only got married for our families' sake.\" \n\n\"Why… Why are you saying such things? Did I do something wrong to you? If you want me to kneel, I will. If you don’t like my face, I will wear a mask for the rest of my life. So, please… please, do not leave my side.\"*\n\nMy husband, whom I married through an arranged marriage, is the second male lead who harbors an unrequited love for the heroine of The Saintess’ Wish, the novel I have possessed. And I, his lawful wife, am destined to endure a lonely marriage before meeting a mysterious death. For my own survival—and for his love—I decided to cleanly end our marriage. But…\n\n*\"Why is he holding onto me? Aren’t you supposed to love Aria???\"\n\n\"This novel’s world… is different from what I knew. What is the truth?\"*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
